# The build context for every sandbox image is THIS directory (images/), and
# the Dockerfiles COPY exactly the files they name out of it: the ACP driver
# and the ship-browser helper. This is an allowlist — everything is ignored
# unless named below — so a stray file dropped beside the Dockerfiles can
# never ride into an image's build context, and context uploads stay small
# and byte-stable.
*
!acp-driver
!acp-driver/ship-acp.mjs
!browser-helper
!browser-helper/ship-browser.mjs
